cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "spyv"
abstract: >-
  Prompt-security testing for AI engineers. Discovers the prompts embedded in an
  agent codebase across CrewAI, LangChain and the OpenAI and Anthropic SDKs, then
  audits, red-teams and guards them. Includes deterministic checks for embedded
  credentials, personal data and prompt leaks that do not depend on a model, a
  tool-call policy engine, and a measurement suite for how much prompt surface a
  static reader can recover.
authors:
